--   **The control builder runs.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegILCtl5`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.Slab.ctlB_runs (s : IState HS) (G : Fin HS → List ℤ) {n n' : ℕ} {src : ℕ → Option ℕ}
--       (argOf : ℕ → ℤ) (hs : J6Seg.MonoSrc n n' src) {LX L1 L2 : List ℤ}
--       (hX : G bX = srcTab src argOf n' ++ LX) (hN' : G bN' = (n' : ℤ) :: L1)
--       (hN : G bN = (n : ℤ) :: L2) {Z : ℕ} (hZ : 1 ≤ Z) (hn : zsz (n : ℤ) ≤ Z)
--       (hn' : zsz (n' : ℤ) ≤ Z) (ha : ∀ l < n', zsz (argOf l) ≤ Z)
--       (hA : G lA = []) (hC : G lC = []) (hD : G lD = []) :
--       IRuns I iprog ctlB (encK s G)
--         (encK s (update (update G rNC (((n + n' : ℕ) : ℤ) :: G rNC)) rC
--           (flatC (J6Seg.ctlOf n n' src argOf) ++ G rC)))
--         (ctlCost Z n n')
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** B-line IL, B1 follow-up: building the control list, §5 the builder
--
--   **`ctlB`** = `const bCur 0; rptX bN' entP; finB; lenB; rptX rNC (mv bT rC; mv bT rC);
--   rptX bN' (mv bSv bX; mv bSv bX)`.
--
--   **`ctlB_runs`**: from any managed state `G` with the source table `srcTab src argOf n'` on top of
--   `bX = 44`, `n'` on `bN' = 20`, `n` on `bN = 21` and empty `rptX` counters, for a monotone source
--   (`MonoSrc n n' src`), the builder pushes `flatC (ctlOf n n' src argOf)` onto `rC = 45` and
--   `n + n'` (`= |ctlOf …|`) onto `rNC = 38`; every other stack is restored (the table included).
--   Cost `≤ (n + n' + 1) (30 cU Z + 20000)` with `Z ≥ 1`, `Z ≥ zsz n, zsz n'`, `Z ≥ zsz (argOf l)`.
